data: {"id": "b2add02049d546fc-final", "run_id": "b2add02049d546fc", "seq": 828, "ts_ms": 1789055446542, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod配置中引用的Secret 'aiops-case-04/workload-input'中缺少容器所需的键' unavailable-key' |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9` 状态 `Pending`，条件 `ContainersReady` 为 `False` (fact-32c9a1ab474b, fact-595285b5eda7) | 描述 Pod 处于停滞状态，未进入运行态 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 容器 `app` 报错：`CreateContainerConfigError` (fact-9e16353c442d) | 指出具体的容器启动失败原因类型 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 错误详情：`couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` (fact-4bd91224a5f1) | 精确定位缺失的资源键，指向 Secret 配置问题 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 `1`，标签 `reason` 为 `CreateContainerConfigError` (fact-e6dd4ee0b39b) | 独立确认容器因配置错误而等待，与 K8s 事件状态一致 |\n\n**证据印证：**\nKubernetes 状态的 `CreateContainerConfigError` 与 Prometheus 监控中对应的 `waiting_reason` 相互印证，共同确认故障发生在 Pod 初始化的配置检查阶段。错误信息明确指出了缺失的 Secret 键，属于静态配置错误，因此日志和追踪维度（Logging/Tracing）均为 `not_applicable` 符合预期。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 中引用 Secret 'aiops-case-04/workload-input' 缺失键 'unavailable-key' → K8s kubelet 启动容器前校验失败 (CreateContainerConfigError) → 容器无法创建 (Waiting状态) → Pod 处于 Pending 且不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**Pod 配置错误导致 Secret 键缺失**。\n\nKubernetes 组件直接返回了明确的错误事实 `fact-4bd91224a5f1`，指出容器 `app` 在加载 `Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` 时找不到所需的键 `'unavailable-key'`。此配置校验失败直接触发了 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态，阻止了容器的启动，表现为 Pod 处于 `Pending` 状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 31.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9: 31.4s (Evidence 27.3s, RCA 4.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 61.033, "metrics": {"run_id": "b2add02049d546fc", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 61.04023289680481, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 61040.23289680481, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 57156.065702438354, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 3, "tool_duration_ms": 10006.858587265015, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3549.9324798583984}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 21019.912719726562, "success": true}, "parallel_e